PLACEHOLDER: this file is not an OpenPGP key.

The Argos APM release signing key (an organization key, docs/19 section 7.4) has not been created
yet, so no release has been signed. A maintainer replaces this file with the ASCII-armored public
key ("-----BEGIN PGP PUBLIC KEY BLOCK-----") and keys/ARGOS-RELEASE-KEY.fingerprint with its
fingerprint, as described in keys/README.md.
